EMBEDDED FONTS
--------------
The typefaces in assets/brand/fonts/ (Cormorant Garamond, EB Garamond and IBM Plex
Mono: cormorant-garamond-600-normal-latin.woff2, CormorantGaramond-600-subset.ttf,
CormorantGaramond-700-subset.ttf, eb-garamond-400-normal-latin.woff2,
eb-garamond-400-italic-latin.woff2 and ibm-plex-mono-400-normal-latin.woff2) are
licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, not under the proprietary terms above.
Their copyright notices and the licence text are in assets/brand/fonts/OFL.txt. Each
document Kshana Pro writes embeds some of them under that licence.

